# Why I'm Taking This Certification

### Goals

- Learn Microsoft 365 Copilot administration fundamentals
- Understand Microsoft 365 architecture and core services
- Learn Purview governance and security concepts
- Understand Copilot deployment and licensing requirements
- Gain foundational knowledge of Microsoft Agents
- Support customers adopting Microsoft 365 Copilot

