# Exam Skills Measured

## Domain 1 – Microsoft 365 Core Services (30–35%)

### Topics

- Microsoft 365 Architecture
- Exchange Online
- SharePoint Online
- OneDrive
- Microsoft Teams
- Entra ID
- Users and Groups
- Licensing

### Learn Modules

- Microsoft 365 Fundamentals
- Teams Fundamentals
- SharePoint Fundamentals
- Entra Fundamentals

---

## Domain 2 – Data Protection and Governance (35–40%)

### Topics

- Microsoft Purview
- Sensitivity Labels
- Data Loss Prevention (DLP)
- Retention Policies
- eDiscovery
- Insider Risk
- Communication Compliance
- DSPM for AI
- Compliance Manager

### Focus Areas

This is the largest exam domain and likely the most important area to study thoroughly.

---

## Domain 3 – Copilot and Agent Administration (25–30%)

### Topics

- Microsoft 365 Copilot
- Copilot Chat
- Copilot Licensing
- Grounding via Microsoft Graph
- Agent Lifecycle
- Copilot Studio
- Security Controls
- Access Management
- Oversharing Protection

### Focus Areas

This is the newest content and where many candidates spend the majority of preparation effort.

